              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 41.42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Immediately Belshazzar ordered his servants to dress Daniel in a robe of royal purple and to hang a gold chain of honour round his neck. And he made him the third in power in the kingdom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That same night Belshazzar, the king of Babylonia, was killed; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Darius the Mede, who was then 62 years old, seized the royal power.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.31"
            ]
          }
